  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local connectivity emergency project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PDO is to reconnect the population of the Northeast CAR to urban centers and local markets by rehabilitating the Kaga-Bandoro &#x2013;Mbr&#xe8;s &#x2013; Bamingui &#x2013; Nd&#xe9;l&#xe9; road.The project will contribute to the State and peace building efforts by ensuring basic transport connectivity between poorly connected areas in districts situated in the lagging regions (North-East). This should contribute to: (a) revitalize local economy by providing temporary employment at local level; (b) facilitate the movement of goods and domestic trade; and (c) State redeployment for development through the Ministry of Equipment and Transport, Civil Aviation, and Integration (Minist&#xe8;re de l&#x2019;Equipement et des Transport, de l&#x2019;Aviation Civile et du D&#xe9;senclavement &#x2013; METACD) decentralized civil servants along the targeted road.</narrative>
  </description>
